+/* This kernel's functionfs.h (whatawurst msm8998 4.4) still uses the
+ * ancient enum values: DESCRIPTORS=1, STRINGS=2, DESCRIPTORS_V2=3.
+ * The modern 0x502/0x503/0x504 values are rejected by
+ * __ffs_data_got_descs with -EINVAL before any descriptor parsing
+ * (verified on-device 2026-10-18: magic 1 accepted, 0x502 EINVAL).
+ * Do not "modernise". */
